<title>USA: New Jersey Resources says sells LP interest.</title>
<headline>New Jersey Resources says sells LP interest.</headline>
<dateline>WALL, N.J. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Jersey Resources Corp said Tuesday it has sold for $9.1 million its 5.67 percent interest in Market Hub Partners LP, a natural gas storage project, to an undisclosed buyer.</p>
<p>NJR said it will use the proceeds of the deal to pay down long-term debt.</p>
<p>NJR bought a its 5.67 percent interest in MHP in December of 1994.</p>
<p>New Jersey Resources Corp provides energy solutions for retail and wholesale customers in New Jersey, and in 17 other states.</p>
</text>
